<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>AI-Based Meal and Diet Planning System</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        'color-1': '#111827',
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
        }

        .project-view {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            color: #93c5fd;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .project-view:hover {
            color: #3b82f6;
        }

        .feature-icon {
            color: #10b981;
        }

        .tech-tag {
            background-color: #dbeafe;
            color: #1e40af;
        }

        .sticky-sidebar {
            position: sticky;
            top: 1.5rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body class="bg-color-1 min-h-screen">
    <section class="bg-color-1">
        <!-- Header Section -->
        <header class="py-8 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                <a href="/#my-projects" class="project-view transition">
                    <i class="fas fa-arrow-left mr-2"></i> Back to Projects
                </a>
                <span class="bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">AI & Web
                    Development</span>
            </div>
            <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mt-6 text-gray-300">AI-Based Meal and Diet Planning System</h1>
            <p class="text-xl text-slate-300 mt-2">An intelligent nutrition platform with personalized meal
                recommendations and progress tracking</p>
        </header>

        <!-- Project Cover Image -->
        <section class="px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto mb-12">
            <div class="rounded-xl shadow-lg overflow-hidden">
                <img src="https://placehold.co/1200x600/1f2937/10b981/png?text=AI+Meal+Planner+Dashboard"
                    alt="AI-Based Meal and Diet Planning System" class="w-full h-auto object-cover">
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Project Details Section -->
        <main class="px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-12 py-8">
            <!-- Main Content -->
            <div class="md:col-span-2">
                <section class="mb-12">
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-300">Project Overview</h2>
                    <p class="mb-4 text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                        This AI-powered meal and diet planning system was developed to provide personalized nutrition
                        recommendations
                        based on user profiles, goals, and preferences. The platform uses intelligent algorithms to
                        calculate optimal
                        calorie and nutrient requirements, track progress, and offer AI-generated meal suggestions.
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                        The system features a comprehensive admin dashboard for managing users, food database, and
                        monitoring
                        platform activity, making it a complete solution for nutrition management.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section class="mb-12">
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-300">Key Features</h2>
                    <ul class="space-y-3">
                        <li class="flex items-start">
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle feature-icon mt-1 mr-2"></i>
                            <span class="text-slate-300">Smart nutrition calculation based on user profile and
                                goals</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start">
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle feature-icon mt-1 mr-2"></i>
                            <span class="text-slate-300">Daily progress tracking with visual indicators</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start">
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle feature-icon mt-1 mr-2"></i>
                            <span class="text-slate-300">Date-based meal planning with interactive calendar</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start">
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle feature-icon mt-1 mr-2"></i>
                            <span class="text-slate-300">Comprehensive food database with quantity tracking</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start">
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle feature-icon mt-1 mr-2"></i>
                            <span class="text-slate-300">Weight and profile management with automatic
                                recalculation</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start">
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle feature-icon mt-1 mr-2"></i>
                            <span class="text-slate-300">Meal reminders and skip alerts with configurable timing</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start">
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle feature-icon mt-1 mr-2"></i>
                            <span class="text-slate-300">AI mood-based food suggestions using Gemini AI
                                integration</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start">
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle feature-icon mt-1 mr-2"></i>
                            <span class="text-slate-300">Comprehensive admin dashboard with user insights and
                                analytics</span>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </section>

                <section class="mb-12">
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-300">Technical Implementation</h2>
                    <div class="space-y-6">
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg text-gray-300">AI Integration</h3>
                            <p class="text-slate-300 mt-1">
                                Integrated Gemini AI API to provide mood-based food recommendations. The system analyzes
                                user's
                                mood input and suggests appropriate meals that align with both nutritional requirements
                                and
                                emotional needs.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg text-gray-300">Real-time Calculations</h3>
                            <p class="text-slate-300 mt-1">
                                Implemented dynamic recalculation of nutritional needs when users update their weight or
                                profile
                                information, ensuring recommendations always match current requirements.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg text-gray-300">Responsive Dashboard</h3>
                            <p class="text-slate-300 mt-1">
                                Developed an interactive admin dashboard with data visualization for user analytics,
                                food management,
                                and system monitoring, providing administrators with comprehensive insights.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <!-- Image Gallery -->
                <section>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-gray-300">Screenshots</h2>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                        <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md">
                            <img src="https://placehold.co/600x400/1f2937/10b981/png?text=User+Dashboard"
                                alt="User Dashboard" class="w-full h-auto cursor-pointer hover:opacity-90 transition">
                        </div>
                        <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md">
                            <img src="https://placehold.co/600x400/1f2937/10b981/png?text=Meal+Planning"
                                alt="Meal Planning Interface"
                                class="w-full h-auto cursor-pointer hover:opacity-90 transition">
                        </div>
                        <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md">
                            <img src="https://placehold.co/600x400/1f2937/10b981/png?text=Progress+Tracking"
                                alt="Progress Tracking"
                                class="w-full h-auto cursor-pointer hover:opacity-90 transition">
                        </div>
                        <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md">
                            <img src="https://placehold.co/600x400/1f2937/10b981/png?text=Admin+Dashboard"
                                alt="Admin Dashboard" class="w-full h-auto cursor-pointer hover:opacity-90 transition">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>
            </div>

            <!-- Sidebar -->
            <div class="md:col-span-1">
                <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md sticky-sidebar">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Project Details</h3>

                    <div class="space-y-5">
                        <div>
                            <h4 class="font-medium text-gray-500">Purpose</h4>
                            <p>Learning & Portfolio</p>
                        </div>

                        <div>
                            <h4 class="font-medium text-gray-500">Date</h4>
                            <p>January 2024 - May 2024</p>
                        </div>

                        <div>
                            <h4 class="font-medium text-gray-500">Technologies</h4>
                            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-2">
                                <span class="tech-tag px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">React.js</span>
                                <span class="tech-tag px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">Node.js</span>
                                <span class="tech-tag px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">Express.js</span>
                                <span class="tech-tag px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">MongoDB</span>
                                <span class="tech-tag px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">Gemini AI API</span>
                                <span class="tech-tag px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">Tailwind CSS</span>
                                <span class="tech-tag px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">JWT Authentication</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="pt-4 space-y-3">
                            <a href="#"
                                class="block w-full bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white text-center py-3 px-4 rounded-lg font-medium transition">
                                <i class="fas fa-external-link-alt mr-2"></i> Live Demo
                            </a>
                            <a href="#"
                                class="block w-full bg-gray-800 hover:bg-gray-900 text-white text-center py-3 px-4 rounded-lg font-medium transition">
                                <i class="fab fa-github mr-2"></i> View Code
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </main>
    </section>

    <!-- Optional JavaScript for image gallery -->
    <script>
        // Simple lightbox functionality
        document.querySelectorAll('img').forEach(img => {
            img.addEventListener('click', () => {
                window.open(img.src, '_blank');
            });
        });
    </script>
</body>

</html>